ÙÍW4AWinstall Project FileAddedFolderEcopath with Ecosim 6.3 BETA	AddedMenuEcopath with Ecosim 6.3 BETAAllowUninstall1AppId&{7535112A-DFA8-499A-8B6C-C71D9E765AAB}	BuildPathC:\Temp\Setup\EwE.exeCheckNet0CheckNetVersion3.5CompanyNameUBC Fisheries CentreCompanyWebSitehttp://www.ecopath.orgCopyrightTitle© 2006 - 2012 ${CompanyName}EULAÿù{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang3084\deflangfe3084\deftab708{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}}
